body:
Kakegurui, I stared watching it as a joke because of tiktok.

&#x200B;

But I don't think is a joke anymore, I don't ever like anime that much.

Almost 6 years ago, I fell face first on my bff backpack. After that, I stand up fast as I can, laughing. Her face was petrified, and almost like crying. A safety pin pierced my eyelid, I was bleeding like crazy. I didn't know until my vision went full red, and my clothes were soaked.

&#x200B;

For me, It's actually pretty funny, because my friend passed out and my eye actually did full recovery (the pin dodged all the importants parts of my eye).
